<p>NOTE: Included in the net loss for the first six months of 1997 is a one-time charge of $83.8 million for acquired in-process research and development related to the ChemGenics Pharmaceuticals Inc merger.</p>
<p>The company said that during the second quarter of 1997, it incurred higher than normal legal and other expenses, primarily associated with the completion of the reorganization begun with the ChemGenics merger, the formation of the Whitehead functional genomics consortium, and the establishment of Millennium BioTherapeutics Inc.</p>
<p>Full name is Millennium Pharmaceuticals Inc.</p>
